E AX3012 466-set-captured.ax:14:16-17 assign-to-immutable "cannot assign to `n` from inside a lambda: the lambda captured its value, not the binding" #"`n` was captured, not shared" ^10:14-15:"`n` is bound outside the lambda, here" !"a closure captures by value when its record is built, so a later `set` inside it could never be observed outside; this used to pass `check` and fail inside codegen as AX4002" ?"return the new value instead, or restructure so the assignment happens where the binding lives"
